 Stop;t
⍝ Stop the Exercise 3 broadcast loop and server (supplied: you don't need to change this)
⍝ Run3 loads this function; Run3 also calls it if the server from an earlier Run3 is still running.
⍝ Usage: Stop
 :If 9=⌊#.⎕NC'Ex3'
     #.Ex3.Running←0 ⍝ Broadcast checks this every time round its loop
 :EndIf
⍝ Wait up to 3 seconds for the loop's thread to end, then stop it anyway
 :If 2=#.⎕NC'Ex3Thread'
     t←⎕AI[3]+3000
     :While (#.Ex3Thread∊⎕TNUMS)∧⎕AI[3]<t
         ⎕DL 0.1
     :EndWhile
     ⎕TKILL #.Ex3Thread∩⎕TNUMS
 :EndIf
 :If 9=⌊#.⎕NC'Ex3Server'
 :AndIf #.Ex3Server.Running
     {}#.Ex3Server.Stop
 :EndIf
 ⎕←'Exercise 3 stopped'
